    "patch_sha256": "38fa5b73f567a2042bff9eaa89cfd3352c4997a73ef4e4ce1d4122df5d644b4f",
    "purpose": "Use the exact official scanner dependency for interface enumeration without any active gateway probe, and correct the pinned Windows allocation ownership defect.",
    "scope": "Only src/interface/unix.rs and src/interface/windows.rs differ from the published crate. No dependency upgrades, registry/cache changes, alternative enumeration algorithm, extra permissions or raw-capture path is added.",
